        <source>Battery optimization</source>
        <target state="translated">电池优化</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BatteryHint">
      <segment>
        <source>Some phones stop background apps aggressively. Exclude NetworkControl from battery optimization if protection turns off by itself.</source>
        <target state="translated">部分手机会积极停止后台应用。如果保护会自行关闭，请将 NetworkControl 排除在电池优化之外。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
